        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:bilj43",
          "html": "South-east of the nature altar, enter the maze by climbing the vine (north side). Do not leave the maze until you have followed all steps in this section.",
          "text": "South-east of the nature altar, enter the maze by climbing the vine (north side). Do not leave the maze until you have followed all steps in this section.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "karamja-vine-maze:bilj43:rq4ofn",
              "html": "Monsters in the maze drop body parts used in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/One_Foot_in_the_Grave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Foot in the Grave</a>. It is recommended to collect these during your time in the maze if you also plan to complete this quest.",
              "text": "Monsters in the maze drop body parts used in One Foot in the Grave. It is recommended to collect these during your time in the maze if you also plan to complete this quest.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:xim6jd",
          "html": "Navigate the maze to reach the roots using the solution provided.",
          "text": "Navigate the maze to reach the roots using the solution provided.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:1cgz6oj",
          "html": "Once you reach the root, <i>dig</i> the loose soil, <i>cut</i> the root, then use it on your plant pot.",
          "text": "Once you reach the root, dig the loose soil, cut the root, then use it on your plant pot.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:1yrad2j",
          "html": "If it does not grow, dig up and cut a different root. Out of the five roots in the area, only one of them can successfully grow. Try a different root until it works.",
          "text": "If it does not grow, dig up and cut a different root. Out of the five roots in the area, only one of them can successfully grow. Try a different root until it works.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "karamja-vine-maze:1yrad2j:pht29g",
              "html": "Fast travelling before covering the plant will <b>destroy the clipping</b>.",
              "text": "Fast travelling before covering the plant will destroy the clipping.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:b7vrni",
          "html": "Once the correct root takes, use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Potted_root\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">potted root</a> on your empty pot to make a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sealed_pot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sealed pot</a>.",
          "text": "Once the correct root takes, use the potted root on your empty pot to make a sealed pot.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "karamja-vine-maze:1iy78bp",
          "html": "If you have not obtained all 6 body parts from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/One_Foot_in_the_Grave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Foot in the Grave</a>, remember to do so before leaving, if that was your plan.",
